ocs-7.25\u0000## routing/bgp/vpn **Conditions:** !smips **Type:** Directory":"## routing/bgp/vpn \n**条件：** !smips\n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## routing/discourse **Type:** Command":"## routing/discourse \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## routing/fantasy **Type:** Directory":"## routing/fantasy \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000A list of all connection-specific parameters can be seen in the table below.":"下表列出了所有特定于连接的参数。","docs-7.25\u0000Cisco VPLS BGP-based auto-discovery(draft-ietf-l2vpn-signaling-08).":"Cisco 基于 BGP 的 VPLS 自动发现（draft-ietf-l2vpn-signaling-08）。","docs-7.25\u0000Clear the session flags. For example, to be able to re-establish a session after the prefix limit is reached \"limit-exceeded\" flag must be cleared. It can be done by specifying `flag` parameter, which is able to take the following values:":"清除会话标志。例如，要在达到前缀限制后重新建立会话，必须清除“limit-exceeded”标志。可通过指定 `flag` 参数完成，该参数可取以下值：","docs-7.25\u0000Dump saved advertisements from specified BGP session in the \\*.pcap file.":"将指定 BGP 会话中保存的通告转储到 \\*.pcap 文件中。","docs-7.25\u0000Fantasy menu is a fancy way to generate large amount of routes for testing purposes. Main benefits of this approach compared to a script are the generation speed and simplicity. It is easy to remove all fantasy generated routes just by disabling the fantasy rule.":"Fantasy 菜单是一种用于生成大量路由以进行测试的便捷方式。与脚本相比，该方法的主要优点是生成速度快且简单。只需禁用 fantasy 规则，即可轻松删除所有由 fantasy 生成的路由。","docs-7.25\u0000Fantasy uses a random generator from hashed route sequence number, seed and other parameters.":"Fantasy 使用基于哈希路由序列号、种子和其他参数的随机生成器。","docs-7.25\u0000In addition to connection-specific parameters, template-specific parameters are also directly exposed in this menu, for easier configuration in simple scenarios(when templates are not necessary).":"除特定于连接的参数外，该菜单中还直接提供了特定于模板的参数，以便在简单场景中更轻松地配置（无需使用模板）。","docs-7.25\u0000L3VPN VPNv4/VPNv6 instance configuration":"L3VPN VPNv4/VPNv6 实例配置","docs-7.25\u0000List of BGP already established, not yet connected or disconnected sessions.":"已建立、尚未连接或已断开的 BGP 会话列表。","docs-7.25\u0000MP-BGP-based autodiscovery and signaling(RFC 4761).":"基于 MP-BGP 的自动发现和信令（RFC 4761）。","docs-7.25\u0000Resend prefixes to a specified BGP session. The command takes two arguments:":"向指定的 BGP 会话重新发送前缀。该命令接受两个参数：","docs-7.25\u0000See EVPN documentation.":"请参阅 EVPN 文档。","docs-7.25\u0000Send route refresh to a specified BGP session. Is used to trigger re-sending all the routes from the remote peer.":"向指定 BGP 会话发送路由刷新。用于触发远端对等体重新发送所有路由。","docs-7.25\u0000Support for multiple import/export route target extended communities for BGP-based VPLS(both, RFC 4761 and draft-ietf-l2vpn-signaling-08).":"支持基于 BGP 的 VPLS 使用多个 import/export route target 扩展团体属性（RFC 4761 和 draft-ietf-l2vpn-signaling-08 均支持）。","docs-7.25\u0000This menu lists all the configured BGP-based VPLS instances. These instances allow the router to advertise VPLS BGP NLRI and indicate that the router belongs to a specific customer VPLS network.":"此菜单列出所有已配置的基于 BGP 的 VPLS 实例。这些实例允许路由器发布 VPLS BGP NLRI，并指示路由器属于特定客户的 VPLS 网络。"}}
